1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,160
Hi, my name is Ryan.

2
00:00:01,160 --> 00:00:02,520
Hi, my name is Tensae Laki.

3
00:00:02,520 --> 00:00:04,960
And we're both Columbia students studying computer science.

4
00:00:04,960 --> 00:00:07,280
Today we built Liquid, a seller's tool

5
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:09,200
to sell products extremely fast.

6
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,560
Imagine you have a bottle that you want to sell,

7
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:14,800
but don't really have the time or capacity to do that.

8
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:16,000
You can just text Liquid

9
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:17,520
and it will sort everything out for you.

10
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:20,320
First, all you have to do is just submit a picture of it

11
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:21,960
and describe it in a few sentences,

12
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:26,080
and then you will have a listing in under five minutes.

13
00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:27,000
Nice, yeah.

14
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,160
And so how it works is OpenAI Vision

15
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:30,240
identifies the item,

16
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:32,440
and then an image model produces the listing photo,

17
00:00:32,440 --> 00:00:34,800
which is redefined and just a little touched up

18
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:37,360
so users can see what the item actually looks like.

19
00:00:37,360 --> 00:00:40,040
And then a second call compares it against the original

20
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:42,080
and blocks any edit changes that could have been bad

21
00:00:42,080 --> 00:00:43,600
or deceitful because we wanted people

22
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:45,240
to see what real products look like.

23
00:00:45,240 --> 00:00:46,840
And then Apify pulls sold

24
00:00:46,840 --> 00:00:48,760
and active daily eBay comps.

25
00:00:48,760 --> 00:00:50,720
So it can basically see what the item looks like

26
00:00:50,720 --> 00:00:52,960
and how it's been sold over time.

27
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:55,320
And then it also has a deterministic pricing engine

28
00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:57,080
so we can have the best price sold

29
00:00:57,080 --> 00:00:58,680
and so that people can actually have

30
00:00:58,680 --> 00:01:00,000
the most fair price for the items

31
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:01,360
and actually have some money back.

32
00:01:01,360 --> 00:01:04,920
We also use BlueBubbles to test our software in general.

33
00:01:04,920 --> 00:01:06,880
BlueBubbles is an iMessage software

34
00:01:06,880 --> 00:01:10,080
that helps you text yourself or have your friend text you

35
00:01:10,080 --> 00:01:12,560
so that you can demo the product.

36
00:01:12,560 --> 00:01:14,160
One thing that separates Liquid

37
00:01:14,160 --> 00:01:15,960
from other sales agents out there

38
00:01:15,960 --> 00:01:18,560
is that we have our own pricing engine,

39
00:01:18,560 --> 00:01:22,160
which takes in all different data points from Apify.

40
00:01:22,160 --> 00:01:24,600
So we scrape active and sold listings.

41
00:01:24,600 --> 00:01:27,400
Then we find out whether or not there was specific copy

42
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:28,520
or specific keywords,

43
00:01:28,520 --> 00:01:30,000
or there was a certain price

44
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:31,720
that people sold something for.

45
00:01:31,720 --> 00:01:34,640
And then we go and price your product at the same

46
00:01:34,640 --> 00:01:37,680
or depending on how fast you want to sell your product,

47
00:01:37,680 --> 00:01:39,200
more or less in price.
